pkg:Evidence_v1_29_0 a quality:Evidence, owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Gate transcript for code-abundance-rdodi v1.29.0 (STORY-14 closed -- real package install, generic failure-communication)"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "MINOR: enabled real package installation (micropip loaded into the main Pyodide instance, a curated safe allowlist of numpy/pandas/networkx shared globally between the safety check and both real execution paths), verified end-to-end with a real headless-browser test actually installing and running each package, not a logic-only check. Removed the prior turn's own case-by-case regex guess from withOneAutoFix and replaced it with a genuinely generic mechanism: every safety check now carries its own remedy field, consumed directly by the retry logic with no label-text inspection or per-case branching. Version bumped correctly before committing: all 4 stages moved to v1_9_0, Cross.D verified. Re-verified: real Playwright install-and-run tests all passing, 0 console errors, all gates PASS fresh, pipeline order (43 subjects, reproduces), full SHACL 0 violations."@en ;
    pub:transcriptSHA256 "084858c56d7f70789b8965144d782b8000bf9f16ff64e884df0d6a00b0f82ef2"^^xsd:string .
